  "description": "Azure Key Vault integration for the SecureRequest NuGet package.\n      Secrets mode: stores the RSA private key as a Key Vault secret.\n      True HSM mode: the RSA key pair lives entirely in Key Vault — private key never\n      enters the app; decryption is delegated to Key Vault's Decrypt API via\n      .WithAzureKeyVaultHsm(uri, keyName).",
